The price of our common and preferred stock is affected by a variety of factors, many of which are outside our control.
Stock price volatility may make it more difficult for investors to sell shares of our common stock and Preferred Stock at times and
prices they find attractive. Our common stock and Preferred Stock prices can fluctuate significantly, over a short period of time, in
response to a variety of factors, including, among other things:
